*5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
