==Strategy==
The goal of this stage is to kill the Wicked Face before an absurd amount of Aku Gories ruin you. To do this, bring a shield piercer such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] or [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] to pierce Wicked Face's shield, and high stat units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] to damage the Wicked Face once the shield's broken. If you want to, you can bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to avoid some wave damage. Don't bring units that are too costly as the stage gives you very little money. There are also UltraBaaBaas, so you need a barrier breaker, best choice being [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]]; Supercar Cat may work, but it failing will cause a significant loss of ground if you do not have any other barrier breakers. Due to the few units needed, Cat Combos are quite useful.

